{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google正式推出Gemini 4系列的新成員Gemini 4 Neon。這款模型定位於複雜編程、分析推理和多步驟任務執行，試圖在高水平智能與運行效率之間取得平衡。Google表示，在早期測試中，Neon的整體質量達到或超過旗艦模型Gemini 4 Carbon，但任務執行速度提高至3倍，完成相同任務的成本僅為Carbon的60%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587006.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.085730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:31:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_hash":"7b939dadefb02ad45d1e2e5cafdc88480cd3af0187e5539851c3eaa8942470fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}